  "behavior": [
    "RefusingApi retained setStepUnit/setStepAllowance now use current patchWorkPackageStepValues for operation identity, preflight and client transport. Exact allowance percent converts to admitted integer request basis points, then normalized callback percentage; foreign and absent facade units refuse before stated mutation.",
    "The response remains the existing Step DTO with allowancePercent, optional code/unit compatibility and current response validation. No new response representation or direct count property on thrown fake Error is introduced.",
    "An EstimateUnitConflict answer becomes the current modeled409wire refusal; malformed count is rejected by the shared decoder before a screen can read it. Current success projection and legitimate0/1000allowance boundaries remain.",
    "The private fake allowance check was duplicated behind the newly validated facade and its old omission proof became vacuous. Remove that duplicate/obsolete proof and document the admitted private callback boundary. An independent rounded-admission fault now fails the unchanged actual fake invalid-allowance/no-state-change test."
  ],
